OL,3,GNEWSAPickup crash victims hit on
OL,4,Apavement, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who died after being struck by
OL,7,Fa pickup truck were walking on the
OL,8,Fpavement when they were hit.
OL,10,FAurelian Porfire, 49, and Dumitru
OL,11,FGheorghe Blidariu, 56, were identified
OL,12,Fearlier at Doncaster Coroner's Court as
OL,13,Fthe inquest into their deaths opened.
OL,15,FThe pair were struck by the Mitsubishi
OL,16,FL200 on White Rose Way in the city on
OL,17,F13 September. The vehicle went on to
OL,18,Fhit two cars on the opposite
OL,19,Fcarriageway. Four people were also
OL,20,Ftaken to hospital with serious
OL,21,Finjuries, police said at the time.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
