OL,3,GNEWSAPickup crash victims hit on
OL,4,Apavement, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 30-year-old driver of the pickup
OL,7,Fwas arrested on suspicion of two counts
OL,8,Fof causing death by dangerous driving,
OL,9,Ftwo counts of causing serious injury by
OL,10,Fdangerous driving and driving while
OL,11,Funfit.
